# The chapter / chunk document model - from CHAPTER.md.
Chapters
description: a fully omni node with a positional body of chunks and subchapters
- >
  A **chapter** is yamlover's document node: a readable page with an optional heading and a body of
  content. It is the schema the web viewer renders as an article. This part defines its shape; the
  inline markup a prose chunk is written in is [marklower](*::documents:marklower). Companion
  language material: the [type lattice](*::language:model), the [schema
  vocabulary](*::meta), the [surface](*::language).
- *: model
- *: schema
- *: attaching
- *: addressing
- *: task
